Options -MultiViews
RewriteEngine On
DirectoryIndex index.html

# The list of post slugs below must be kept in sync with the .html files
# in this folder — add a new slug here whenever a new post is added.
# Using an explicit list (rather than a filesystem -f test) avoids relying
# on DOCUMENT_ROOT/CONTEXT_DOCUMENT_ROOT, which do NOT reliably resolve to
# "the folder this .htaccess lives in" when deployed inside a plain
# subfolder (as opposed to an Apache Alias) — only pure URL pattern
# matching behaves consistently across hosts in that situation.
#
# All redirect (R=301) rules below build the destination from THE_REQUEST
# (the client's original request line) rather than a relative substitution.
# On this host, relative redirect substitutions in per-directory context
# were found to produce a literal filesystem path in the Location header
# instead of a URL path — THE_REQUEST-based absolute paths avoid that bug
# and work correctly at any folder depth.

# 1) A relative link from one post to another (e.g. /post-a/post-b.html,
#    reached because the browser resolves post-b.html against post-a's
#    own clean trailing-slash URL) is real navigation — redirect to
#    post-b's own clean canonical URL so the address bar is correct.
RewriteCond %{THE_REQUEST} \s/+(.*/)?(?:10-colour-choices-that-will-make-your-cafe-look-huge|10-impressive-restaurants-to-visit-across-india|10-must-have-commercial-kitchen-equipment|10-things-to-consider-while-opening-a-restaurant|2025-restaurant-design-trends-smart-materials-that-maximize-space|5-inexpensive-personal-touches-for-your-coffee-shop|5-tips-tricks-restaurant-should-follow-to-attract-customers|5-ways-to-redesign-your-old-bar-with-modern-touch|6-points-to-remember-while-designing-a-new-restaurant|7-budget-friendly-restaurant-design-ideas|7-premium-cafe-coffee-shops-who-preferred-interior-more-than-anything|7-top-hotel-design-concepts-to-be-followed-in-2019|8-best-decoration-ideas-by-designers-for-the-coming-new-year|8-points-to-follow-while-designing-a-restaurant-bar|8-tips-to-focus-on-eco-friendly-hotel-interior|bill-of-quantities|branding-secret-successful-restaurant-design|five-things-you-need-to-know-about-commercial-interior-designing-today|how-restaurant-interiors-can-help-you-achieve-growth-in-business|how-to-finalise-bakery-menu|how-to-run-a-successful-bar-restaurant|how-to-select-the-best-location-to-start-my-restaurant|how-to-set-up-a-commercial-kitchen|how-to-start-a-restaurant-with-no-previous-experience|indias-best-restaurant-interior-designer-firm|premium-restaurant-design-ideas|premium-restaurants-design-and-build-strategies-for-success|restaurant-interior-design-7-things-to-consider-when-designing-one|simple-and-smart-design-for-your-restaurant-cafe|top-10-things-to-keep-in-mind-while-designing-your-restaurant-kitchen|top-5-styles-of-furniture-you-can-apply-in-your-coffee-shop|what-are-the-current-trends-that-i-should-follow-in-order-to-have-the-best-interior-for-my-restaurant|what-style-should-i-choose-for-my-restaurant|what-to-expect-when-you-hire-a-restaurant-interior-designer-to-re-decorate-your-restaurant|what-to-look-for-when-planning-to-refurbish-your-restaurant-interior|why-restaurant-funding-easier-in-india-2025)/(10-colour-choices-that-will-make-your-cafe-look-huge|10-impressive-restaurants-to-visit-across-india|10-must-have-commercial-kitchen-equipment|10-things-to-consider-while-opening-a-restaurant|2025-restaurant-design-trends-smart-materials-that-maximize-space|5-inexpensive-personal-touches-for-your-coffee-shop|5-tips-tricks-restaurant-should-follow-to-attract-customers|5-ways-to-redesign-your-old-bar-with-modern-touch|6-points-to-remember-while-designing-a-new-restaurant|7-budget-friendly-restaurant-design-ideas|7-premium-cafe-coffee-shops-who-preferred-interior-more-than-anything|7-top-hotel-design-concepts-to-be-followed-in-2019|8-best-decoration-ideas-by-designers-for-the-coming-new-year|8-points-to-follow-while-designing-a-restaurant-bar|8-tips-to-focus-on-eco-friendly-hotel-interior|bill-of-quantities|branding-secret-successful-restaurant-design|five-things-you-need-to-know-about-commercial-interior-designing-today|how-restaurant-interiors-can-help-you-achieve-growth-in-business|how-to-finalise-bakery-menu|how-to-run-a-successful-bar-restaurant|how-to-select-the-best-location-to-start-my-restaurant|how-to-set-up-a-commercial-kitchen|how-to-start-a-restaurant-with-no-previous-experience|indias-best-restaurant-interior-designer-firm|premium-restaurant-design-ideas|premium-restaurants-design-and-build-strategies-for-success|restaurant-interior-design-7-things-to-consider-when-designing-one|simple-and-smart-design-for-your-restaurant-cafe|top-10-things-to-keep-in-mind-while-designing-your-restaurant-kitchen|top-5-styles-of-furniture-you-can-apply-in-your-coffee-shop|what-are-the-current-trends-that-i-should-follow-in-order-to-have-the-best-interior-for-my-restaurant|what-style-should-i-choose-for-my-restaurant|what-to-expect-when-you-hire-a-restaurant-interior-designer-to-re-decorate-your-restaurant|what-to-look-for-when-planning-to-refurbish-your-restaurant-interior|why-restaurant-funding-easier-in-india-2025)\.html[\s?] [NC]
RewriteRule ^ /%1%2/ [R=301,L]

# 2) A relative link to index.html from within a post (the "Back to
#    Insights" link) — redirect to this folder's own root.
RewriteCond %{THE_REQUEST} \s/+(.*/)?(?:10-colour-choices-that-will-make-your-cafe-look-huge|10-impressive-restaurants-to-visit-across-india|10-must-have-commercial-kitchen-equipment|10-things-to-consider-while-opening-a-restaurant|2025-restaurant-design-trends-smart-materials-that-maximize-space|5-inexpensive-personal-touches-for-your-coffee-shop|5-tips-tricks-restaurant-should-follow-to-attract-customers|5-ways-to-redesign-your-old-bar-with-modern-touch|6-points-to-remember-while-designing-a-new-restaurant|7-budget-friendly-restaurant-design-ideas|7-premium-cafe-coffee-shops-who-preferred-interior-more-than-anything|7-top-hotel-design-concepts-to-be-followed-in-2019|8-best-decoration-ideas-by-designers-for-the-coming-new-year|8-points-to-follow-while-designing-a-restaurant-bar|8-tips-to-focus-on-eco-friendly-hotel-interior|bill-of-quantities|branding-secret-successful-restaurant-design|five-things-you-need-to-know-about-commercial-interior-designing-today|how-restaurant-interiors-can-help-you-achieve-growth-in-business|how-to-finalise-bakery-menu|how-to-run-a-successful-bar-restaurant|how-to-select-the-best-location-to-start-my-restaurant|how-to-set-up-a-commercial-kitchen|how-to-start-a-restaurant-with-no-previous-experience|indias-best-restaurant-interior-designer-firm|premium-restaurant-design-ideas|premium-restaurants-design-and-build-strategies-for-success|restaurant-interior-design-7-things-to-consider-when-designing-one|simple-and-smart-design-for-your-restaurant-cafe|top-10-things-to-keep-in-mind-while-designing-your-restaurant-kitchen|top-5-styles-of-furniture-you-can-apply-in-your-coffee-shop|what-are-the-current-trends-that-i-should-follow-in-order-to-have-the-best-interior-for-my-restaurant|what-style-should-i-choose-for-my-restaurant|what-to-expect-when-you-hire-a-restaurant-interior-designer-to-re-decorate-your-restaurant|what-to-look-for-when-planning-to-refurbish-your-restaurant-interior|why-restaurant-funding-easier-in-india-2025)/index\.html[\s?] [NC]
RewriteRule ^ /%1 [R=301,L]

# 3) A relative asset request (css/js/images) resolved against a post's
#    canonical URL is a background load, not navigation — serve it
#    transparently from this folder's root, no redirect round-trip.
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule ^(?:10-colour-choices-that-will-make-your-cafe-look-huge|10-impressive-restaurants-to-visit-across-india|10-must-have-commercial-kitchen-equipment|10-things-to-consider-while-opening-a-restaurant|2025-restaurant-design-trends-smart-materials-that-maximize-space|5-inexpensive-personal-touches-for-your-coffee-shop|5-tips-tricks-restaurant-should-follow-to-attract-customers|5-ways-to-redesign-your-old-bar-with-modern-touch|6-points-to-remember-while-designing-a-new-restaurant|7-budget-friendly-restaurant-design-ideas|7-premium-cafe-coffee-shops-who-preferred-interior-more-than-anything|7-top-hotel-design-concepts-to-be-followed-in-2019|8-best-decoration-ideas-by-designers-for-the-coming-new-year|8-points-to-follow-while-designing-a-restaurant-bar|8-tips-to-focus-on-eco-friendly-hotel-interior|bill-of-quantities|branding-secret-successful-restaurant-design|five-things-you-need-to-know-about-commercial-interior-designing-today|how-restaurant-interiors-can-help-you-achieve-growth-in-business|how-to-finalise-bakery-menu|how-to-run-a-successful-bar-restaurant|how-to-select-the-best-location-to-start-my-restaurant|how-to-set-up-a-commercial-kitchen|how-to-start-a-restaurant-with-no-previous-experience|indias-best-restaurant-interior-designer-firm|premium-restaurant-design-ideas|premium-restaurants-design-and-build-strategies-for-success|restaurant-interior-design-7-things-to-consider-when-designing-one|simple-and-smart-design-for-your-restaurant-cafe|top-10-things-to-keep-in-mind-while-designing-your-restaurant-kitchen|top-5-styles-of-furniture-you-can-apply-in-your-coffee-shop|what-are-the-current-trends-that-i-should-follow-in-order-to-have-the-best-interior-for-my-restaurant|what-style-should-i-choose-for-my-restaurant|what-to-expect-when-you-hire-a-restaurant-interior-designer-to-re-decorate-your-restaurant|what-to-look-for-when-planning-to-refurbish-your-restaurant-interior|why-restaurant-funding-easier-in-india-2025)/(.+)$ $1 [END]

# 4) /index.html requested directly should redirect to this folder's own
#    root, not to /index/.
RewriteCond %{THE_REQUEST} \s/+(.*)index\.html[\s?] [NC]
RewriteRule ^ /%1 [R=301,L]

# 5) Any other *.html URL requested directly gets redirected to the
#    clean, trailing-slash URL (e.g. /post-name/). Keeps one canonical
#    URL per post.
RewriteCond %{THE_REQUEST} \s/+(.+)\.html[\s?] [NC]
RewriteRule ^ /%1/ [R=301,L]

# 6) A clean URL requested without a trailing slash, where a matching
#    .html file exists, gets redirected to add the trailing slash.
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} !/$
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME}.html -f
RewriteCond %{THE_REQUEST} \s/+([^\s?]+)[\s?] [NC]
RewriteRule ^ /%1/ [R=301,L]

# 7) Internally serve the matching .html file when a post's trailing-slash
#    URL is requested, without changing what's shown in the address bar.
RewriteRule ^(10-colour-choices-that-will-make-your-cafe-look-huge|10-impressive-restaurants-to-visit-across-india|10-must-have-commercial-kitchen-equipment|10-things-to-consider-while-opening-a-restaurant|2025-restaurant-design-trends-smart-materials-that-maximize-space|5-inexpensive-personal-touches-for-your-coffee-shop|5-tips-tricks-restaurant-should-follow-to-attract-customers|5-ways-to-redesign-your-old-bar-with-modern-touch|6-points-to-remember-while-designing-a-new-restaurant|7-budget-friendly-restaurant-design-ideas|7-premium-cafe-coffee-shops-who-preferred-interior-more-than-anything|7-top-hotel-design-concepts-to-be-followed-in-2019|8-best-decoration-ideas-by-designers-for-the-coming-new-year|8-points-to-follow-while-designing-a-restaurant-bar|8-tips-to-focus-on-eco-friendly-hotel-interior|bill-of-quantities|branding-secret-successful-restaurant-design|five-things-you-need-to-know-about-commercial-interior-designing-today|how-restaurant-interiors-can-help-you-achieve-growth-in-business|how-to-finalise-bakery-menu|how-to-run-a-successful-bar-restaurant|how-to-select-the-best-location-to-start-my-restaurant|how-to-set-up-a-commercial-kitchen|how-to-start-a-restaurant-with-no-previous-experience|indias-best-restaurant-interior-designer-firm|premium-restaurant-design-ideas|premium-restaurants-design-and-build-strategies-for-success|restaurant-interior-design-7-things-to-consider-when-designing-one|simple-and-smart-design-for-your-restaurant-cafe|top-10-things-to-keep-in-mind-while-designing-your-restaurant-kitchen|top-5-styles-of-furniture-you-can-apply-in-your-coffee-shop|what-are-the-current-trends-that-i-should-follow-in-order-to-have-the-best-interior-for-my-restaurant|what-style-should-i-choose-for-my-restaurant|what-to-expect-when-you-hire-a-restaurant-interior-designer-to-re-decorate-your-restaurant|what-to-look-for-when-planning-to-refurbish-your-restaurant-interior|why-restaurant-funding-easier-in-india-2025)/$ $1.html [NC,L]
